 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "root",
   "x": 197,
   "y": 10,
   "w": 760,
   "kind": "dark",
   "title": "High glucose: is it DIABETES, and WHICH TYPE?",
   "lines": [
    "the same cut-offs for type 1 and type 2: they mark where RETINOPATHY risk rises",
    "symptoms (thirst, polyuria, weight loss) → ONE abnormal test is enough · none → repeat on ANOTHER day",
    "acutely ill (heart attack, sepsis, high-dose steroids) → suspect, confirm once recovered"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "g_below",
   "x": 45,
   "y": 156,
   "w": 512,
   "h": 78,
   "kind": "plain",
   "title": "BELOW the line: NOT YET diabetes",
   "lines": [
    "grey zone: fasting 6.1–6.9 · 2-h 75 g 7.8–11.0 mmol/L · glycated hemoglobin (A1c) 6.0–6.4%"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "g_dm",
   "x": 597,
   "y": 156,
   "w": 512,
   "h": 78,
   "kind": "plain",
   "title": "AT or ABOVE the line: DIABETES",
   "lines": [
    "ANY ONE: fasting ≥ 7.0 · 2-h 75 g or random ≥ 11.1 mmol/L · A1c ≥ 6.5% (adults, NOT if type 1 is suspected)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_type",
   "x": 597,
   "y": 274,
   "w": 512,
   "h": 78,
   "kind": "plain",
   "title": "WHICH TYPE? Usually time and the response to treatment tell",
   "lines": [
    "still unsure → C-peptide (is she making insulin?) + anti-glutamic acid decarboxylase (anti-GAD) antibodies"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "pre_head_0_0",
   "x": 45,
   "y": 432,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 78,
   "kind": "pre_h",
   "title": "Prediabetes",
   "lines": [
    "impaired fasting glucose (IFG) or impaired glucose tolerance (IGT)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t1e_head_0_0",
   "x": 307,
   "y": 432,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 78,
   "kind": "t1e_h",
   "title": "Type 1, stages 1–2",
   "lines": [
    "beta-cell autoimmunity, NO symptoms yet"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t1_head_0_0",
   "x": 597,
   "y": 432,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 78,
   "kind": "t1_h",
   "title": "Type 1: new onset (stage 3)",
   "lines": [
    "autoimmune beta-cell loss → ABSOLUTE insulin deficiency"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t2_head_0_0",
   "x": 859,
   "y": 432,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 78,
   "kind": "t2_h",
   "title": "Type 2",
   "lines": [
    "insulin RESISTANCE + RELATIVE deficiency: both present by diagnosis"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "pre_pres_0_0",
   "x": 45,
   "y": 550,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 232,
   "kind": "pre_t",
   "title": "No symptoms",
   "lines": [
    "type 2 can sit here for YEARS first"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t1e_pres_0_0",
   "x": 307,
   "y": 550,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 232,
   "kind": "t1e_t",
   "title": "Often a relative with type 1",
   "lines": [
    "• identical twin 50%",
    "• sibling 5% (no family: 0.4%)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t1_pres_0_0",
   "x": 597,
   "y": 550,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 105,
   "kind": "t1_t",
   "title": "ACUTE: polyuria, thirst, weight LOSS",
   "lines": [
    "• new bed-wetting, nocturia",
    "• appetite unchanged"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t1_pres_1_0",
   "x": 597,
   "y": 677,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 105,
   "kind": "bad",
   "title": "Vomiting · abdominal pain · fast breathing · drowsy",
   "lines": [
    "→ diabetic ketoacidosis (DKA): see the COMPLICATIONS chart"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t2_pres_0_0",
   "x": 859,
   "y": 550,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 96,
   "kind": "t2_t",
   "title": "SLOW: years in the grey zone",
   "lines": [
    "• few or no symptoms",
    "• recent weight GAIN, or stopped exercising"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t2_pres_1_0",
   "x": 859,
   "y": 668,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 114,
   "kind": "t2_w",
   "title": "Risk",
   "lines": [
    "• parent with type 2, previous gestational diabetes",
    "• Asian, South Asian, Hispanic, Indigenous, African descent"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "pre_inv_0_0",
   "x": 45,
   "y": 822,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 200,
   "kind": "pre_w",
   "title": "1 · Look for metabolic syndrome",
   "lines": [
    "• high blood pressure",
    "• low high-density lipoprotein (HDL), high triglycerides",
    "• waist-to-hip ratio ↑ (visceral fat)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t1e_inv_0_0",
   "x": 307,
   "y": 822,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 99,
   "kind": "t1e_w",
   "title": "1 · COUNT the islet autoantibodies",
   "lines": [
    "• 1 alone: no added risk",
    "• 2 or more: risk climbs with each"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t1e_inv_1_0",
   "x": 307.0,
   "y": 943,
   "w": 120.0,
   "h": 79,
   "kind": "t1e_w",
   "title": "Stage 1",
   "lines": [
    "glucose NORMAL"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t1e_inv_1_1",
   "x": 437.0,
   "y": 943,
   "w": 120.0,
   "h": 79,
   "kind": "t1e_w",
   "title": "Stage 2",
   "lines": [
    "glucose in the GREY ZONE"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t1_inv_0_0",
   "x": 597,
   "y": 822,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 88,
   "kind": "t1_t",
   "title": "1 · Random glucose ≥ 11.1",
   "lines": [
    "+ urine dipstick: glucose AND ketones"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t1_inv_1_0",
   "x": 597,
   "y": 932,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 90,
   "kind": "t1_w",
   "title": "Fasting glucose, A1c: usually unnecessary",
   "lines": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t2_inv_0_0",
   "x": 859,
   "y": 822,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 80,
   "kind": "t2_t",
   "title": "1 · Few symptoms → REPEAT the test",
   "lines": [
    "on another day"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t2_inv_1_0",
   "x": 859,
   "y": 924,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 98,
   "kind": "t2_w",
   "title": "2 · Metabolic syndrome as well?",
   "lines": [
    "→ even higher cardiovascular risk",
    "• also ask about sleep apnea"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "pre_tx_0_0",
   "x": 45,
   "y": 1062,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 270,
   "kind": "ok",
   "title": "The TARGET for prevention",
   "lines": [
    "see the PREVENTION OF TYPE 2 DIABETES chart"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t1e_tx_0_0",
   "x": 307,
   "y": 1062,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 270,
   "kind": "warn",
   "title": "Stage 3 = SYMPTOMS",
   "lines": [
    "→ treat as new-onset type 1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t1_tx_0_0",
   "x": 597,
   "y": 1062,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 132,
   "kind": "ok",
   "title": "1 · INSULIN: basal + bolus",
   "lines": [
    "• 3/day: intermediate (NPH) + fast-acting",
    "• 4/day: long-acting + fast-acting, or a pump",
    "~lows: see the COMPLICATIONS chart"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t1_tx_1_0",
   "x": 597,
   "y": 1216,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 116,
   "kind": "ok",
   "title": "2 · Teach: a multidisciplinary team",
   "lines": [
    "• glucose 4×/day, every 2–3 h when ill",
    "• carbohydrate counting",
    "• pumps, continuous glucose monitors"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t2_tx_0_0",
   "x": 859,
   "y": 1062,
   "w": 250,
   "h": 124,
   "kind": "ok",
   "title": "1 · Weight, activity, diet",
   "lines": [
    "glucose can fall BELOW the line → recheck periodically"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t2_tx_1_0",
   "x": 859,
